  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       TAB 2: MVP FLOW
       Horizontal swimlanes — one per Act (0–12).
       Screen box styles:
         Bold border (strokeWidth=3)  = LIST+FIND entry-point screen
         Solid thin border            = regular screen
         Dashed border                = modal / confirmation
       Phase colour coding:
         Blue tint  (#f0f7ff / #dae8fc) — INCEPTION  (Acts 0–3)
         Gold tint  (#fffaec / #fff2cc) — CALIBRATION (Acts 4–8)
         Orange tint(#fff0e0 / #ffe6cc) — ACTION      (Acts 9–12)
